# Byte-stability guardrail: frozen instruments (.jsonl) and run outputs (.csv)
# carry sha256 digests recorded in run manifests. Line-ending conversion on
# checkout (core.autocrlf) silently changes their bytes and breaks digest
# verification (observed 2026-07-21 on a Windows checkout: working-tree
# pretest_probes_v2.jsonl hashed 37da6b20… while the committed blob hashed the
# frozen 659afb97…). -text disables all eol conversion for these files.
*.jsonl -text
*.csv -text
# Same rationale for .json: lexeme_blocklists.json's sha256 is recorded in
# battery validation reports; run/ingest manifests are digest-bearing too.
*.json -text
